Z||000000||Cheever3000||08-16-2001||07:15 PM||||I am about to be featured in my company newsletter, and was given a biographical questionnaire to complete.  The last question is...<P>Do you have any interesting hobbies or what do you like to do on your off time?<P>Here is how I am considering answering it (don't have much space)...<P>I am involved at an international level in the preservation and enjoyment of the Pontiac Fiero, America’s only mid-engine 2-seat sports car.  I have an 88 GT and an 88 Coupe.<P>Any advice for different wording would be appreciated.  It's no big deal, the company has about 450 - 500 employees.  I just want to represent you well.  Any ideas?<P>||||reg||2
