Z||000003||Galen||08-16-2001||09:00 PM||||*sniff* *sniff*  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"> thought I stepped in something.. sorry..<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="purple">Ray</FONT> <FONT COLOR="gray">-</FONT> <FONT COLOR="purple"><A HREF="http://www.fierolinks.f2s.com/" TARGET=_blank>Fierolinks.f2.com/</A></FONT><BR>In the event I offended you, Let me state this apology. - I am incredibly sorry for my personal views, which I am granted under united states constitution to have, offended you in anyway. If you do not accept this apology. Please by all means, tell me! -||||reg||1
Z||000004||Cheever3000||08-16-2001||10:58 PM||||Galen you crack me up.  <BR>It's going to get deeper.  Here's what I think I'll say...<P>I am involved at an international level in the preservation and enjoyment of the Pontiac Fiero, America’s only mid-engine 2-seater production sports car, made from 1984 to 88.  I have two of them.  I created & administer a parts relay volunteer effort to facilitate transportation of needed parts amongst Fiero owners in North America,and I am a member of local, national and Internet clubs & forums dedicated to sharing the technical knowledge necessary to maintain the remaining Fieros.<P>(Where's that "Battle Hymn" music coming from?)<P>Get those cars shined up to sell, folks.  I may have a whole building full of buyers for you when this newsletter comes out!  They'll be joining PFF in droves!  The Lone Star Fieros meeting attendance will swell!  We'll have Fieros in parades.  Car shops exclusively for us will spring up in every neighborhood.<P>"Wake up... Chuck!  Hey!  Wake up!"<BR>"Huh?  Oh, wow, I must have dozed off.  What a wonderful dream I was having!"<P>||||reg||1
